{"h":3172,"lines":[{"x":0.097730315392582465,"c":1,"w":0.11739925384521484,"t":"Audioscripts","y":0.045819939482254823,"h":0.017371748915837038},{"y":0.09738372098183623,"h":0.011627906808937327,"x":0.097888675090799404,"t":"SAM.","w":0.036468331019083644,"c":1},{"t":"ANDREW:","x":0.097888674248009622,"c":1,"h":0.011627906808937327,"w":0.065259119669596355,"y":0.14534883727244163},{"c":1,"t":"SAM:","y":0.17732558159082901,"w":0.036468331019083644,"x":0.097888675090799404,"h":0.010174418157166243},{"w":0.036468331019083672,"t":"SAM:","y":0.21656976742886469,"c":1,"x":0.097888675293401228,"h":0.011627906808937327},{"y":0.24816092120230659,"h":0.010945599136256257,"w":0.063548641204833986,"c":1,"x":0.099703607264169533,"t":"ANDREW:"},{"c":1,"h":0.011627906808937327,"y":0.29651162787460117,"x":0.097888676943638966,"w":0.036468327840169276,"t":"SAM:"},{"t":"ANDREW.","h":0.0090337178445554223,"w":0.063413785298665371,"x":0.099771034321156193,"y":0.31379709455200877,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.10172744647415563,"y":0.3619186046884405,"t":"SAM.","w":0.032629559834798177,"h":0.0087209301067029399},{"x":0.19379490849459965,"y":0.092665895441195412,"t":"Great! I'Il need to ask you about food, but something else that's important is","w":0.58554962158203117,"c":1,"h":0.018704585139116991},{"c":1,"x":0.19378239356637322,"h":0.019066196071244712,"y":0.10887357592991631,"w":0.59900756835937496,"t":"accommodation. You obviously have rooms in the hotel, but do you also have"},{"c":1,"x":0.19369543075121223,"y":0.12490539007674706,"t":"any other accommodation, like cabins, for example?","h":0.020000446940129812,"w":0.40537035624186202},{"h":0.01613317071113729,"c":1,"y":0.14244186072766318,"t":"Yes, there are five in the grounds, all self-contained. They each sleep two to four","x":0.19385795487815585,"w":0.62380040486653654},{"h":0.016760770790513857,"w":0.52602813720703123,"t":"people and have their own living room, bathroom and small kitchen.","c":1,"x":0.19378701529014422,"y":0.15777225743145318},{"c":1,"h":0.016078184110971061,"t":"That sounds perfect for what we'll need","w":0.3071017201741536,"x":0.193857968991618,"y":0.17433795689604026},{"y":0.21298360475050016,"h":0.018073376009773878,"t":"Now you have various facilities, don't you? Are they all included in the price of","x":0.19379506119363177,"w":0.60476374308268233,"c":1},{"w":0.30710172017415366,"c":1,"x":0.19385796898976054,"y":0.23108448910871504,"h":0.014555045966091806,"t":"hiring the room? The pool, for instance."},{"t":"Normally you'd be able to use it, but itI be closed throughout September for","y":0.24709302305762482,"w":0.59117080688476553,"h":0.014571541645487796,"x":0.1938579745790556,"c":1},{"t":"refurbishment. I'm afraid. The gym will be available, though, at no extra charge.","x":0.19385797264394208,"h":0.014817150063051732,"y":0.26292559928176829,"c":1,"w":0.61420344034830732},{"w":0.44529749552408848,"t":"That's open all day, from six in the morning until midnight.","x":0.19385796999732538,"h":0.014600868032679015,"y":0.27900378332240905,"c":1},{"x":0.19372037040920476,"c":1,"t":"And the tennis courts, but there is a small additional payment for those. We have","y":0.30758228010433952,"h":0.020758697394314463,"w":0.62790496826171871},{"w":0.63147791544596354,"t":"four courts, and it's worth booking in advance if you possibly can, as there can be","x":0.19193858536604089,"y":0.32692307679474686,"h":0.01610017875103753,"c":1},{"x":0.19385796931676566,"y":0.34300126097215533,"c":1,"t":"quite a long waiting list for them!","w":0.25335891723632809,"h":0.014556878752546076},{"w":0.58349329630533853,"x":0.19385795826785057,"c":1,"t":"Right. Now could we discuss the food? This would be dinner, around seven","y":0.35901162770855943,"h":0.014569708859033526},{"w":0.15163148244222002,"x":0.099808059066797836,"h":0.01613866967180777,"t":"SECTION 2","c":1,"y":0.42717528354021117},{"c":1,"w":0.70249521891276046,"t":"Hello everyone. I'm Jake Stevens and I'm your rep here at the hotel. I'm sure you'll all have","h":0.013081395460708523,"x":0.10172743842817066,"y":0.45639534877939947},{"c":1,"t":"a great time here. So let me tell you a bit about what's on offer. I'll start by telling you about","y":0.47106335137833932,"w":0.70258717854817698,"x":0.101680294722804,"h":0.016233920449717498},{"t":"some of the excursions that are available for guests","x":0.099660033153714189,"h":0.019181766245434329,"c":1,"y":0.48562552155067495,"w":0.40340044657389318},{"w":0.68330134073893234,"y":0.51292559928261905,"c":1,"h":0.014817150063051732,"t":"One thing you have to do while you're here is go dolphin watching. On our boat trips, we","x":0.099808062732331462},{"h":0.014600868032679237,"c":1,"x":0.099808051656643873,"t":"pretty well guarantee you'll see dolphins - if you don't you can repeat the trip free of charge.","y":0.52900378332372322,"w":0.71401153564453124},{"c":1,"y":0.54505813933693315,"h":0.014534884112479607,"t":"We organise daily trips for just 35 euros. Unfortunately there aren't any places left for this","x":0.099808053605104405,"w":0.69097890218098967},{"w":0.52219034830729172,"h":0.015796740749594806,"t":"afternoon's trip, but come and see me to book for later in the week.","x":0.097838178808788326,"y":0.56098460749778789,"c":1},{"h":0.014540382471842306,"y":0.58575031539601419,"c":1,"x":0.097888671224307541,"t":"If you're energetic, I'd recommend our forest waik. It's a guided walk of about seven","w":0.65067179361979166},{"w":0.70249521891276046,"t":"kilometres. Therel be a stop half way, and you'll be provided with a drink and sandwiches.","y":0.60174418584861822,"h":0.014586205139737407,"x":0.099808052629315025,"c":1},{"w":0.036468331019083644,"x":0.83301343516824133,"t":"Q12","y":0.60174418594969659,"h":0.013081395460708412,"c":1},{"y":0.61759142482625595,"x":0.099808061756262514,"h":0.016129505138228861,"w":0.69481765747070312,"t":"There's some fairly steep climbs up the hills, so you need to be reasonably fit for this one,","c":1},{"y":0.63366960886744095,"w":0.7274472045898438,"t":"with good shoes, and bring a waterproof in case it rains. It's just 25 euros all inclusive, and it's","h":0.016078184110971061,"x":0.097888681676319603,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"every Wednesday.","y":0.64970930211163813,"w":0.14587332407633463,"x":0.099808059578915198,"h":0.014540382471842195},{"x":0.10172743836578652,"t":"Then on Thursdays we organise a cycle trip, which will give you all the fun of biking without","y":0.67296511607991494,"w":0.70249521891276046,"h":0.014613698740474579,"c":1},{"t":"the effort. We'll take you and your bike up to the top of Mount Larna, and leave you to bike","w":0.6968343607584635,"x":0.099755838524097931,"y":0.68866573733996339,"h":0.01527132392681263,"c":1},{"h":0.016879930772817464,"t":"back - it's a 700-metre drop in just 20 kilometres so this isn't really for inexperienced cyclists Q13","c":1,"x":0.097835687552700862,"y":0.70432855331689481,"w":0.77168701171874987},{"t":"as you'll be going pretty fast. And if it's a clear day, you'll have fantastic views.","c":1,"h":0.01614416803117058,"y":0.72093023281688229,"x":0.099808060812036914,"w":0.60460652669270831},{"t":"On our local craft tour you can find out about the traditional activities in the island. And","h":0.013240857503152514,"y":0.74558638100892305,"c":1,"w":0.66410746256510411,"x":0.10172745847669347},{"y":0.76083172332140248,"x":0.097826356493183372,"w":0.68534128824869789,"c":1,"h":0.016966200416055122,"t":"the best thing about this trip is that it's completely free. You'll be taken to a factory where"},{"y":0.76308139540044095,"x":0.83301343515691162,"t":"Q14","w":0.036468331019083644,"h":0.011627906808937327,"c":1},{"w":0.72168904622395835,"h":0.013081395460708412,"x":0.09788868215117863,"y":0.77761627901180697,"c":1,"t":"jewellery is made, and also a ceramics centre. If you want, you can buy some of the products"},{"h":0.016780586290780386,"c":1,"t":"but that's entirely up to you. The trip starts after lunch on Thursday, and you'll return by 6 pm.","x":0.099740560578368609,"y":0.79196878924999636,"w":0.71797551472981769},{"w":0.67946258544921878,"c":1,"y":0.81683480469173064,"h":0.014560544325454505,"t":"If you're interested in astronomy you may already know that the island's one of the best","x":0.097888668149128458},{"w":0.70262924194335941,"h":0.016464211751353375,"c":1,"t":"places in the world to observe the night sky. We can offer trips to the observatory on Friday","y":0.831303656105981,"x":0.099750957979912958},{"h":0.017461296889700773,"c":1,"y":0.84802900773512568,"x":0.097803971338338444,"w":0.69880086263020835,"t":"for those who are interested. They cost 90 euros per person and you'll be shown the huge"},{"t":"telescopes and have a talk from an expert, who'll explain all about how they work. Afterwards Q15","x":0.095917251379383783,"y":0.86429842316482541,"w":0.77361007690429684,"h":0.017022962678425846,"c":1},{"x":0.09788867450167478,"y":0.88226744212388186,"t":"we head down to Sunset Beach, where you can have a dip in the ocean if you want before","w":0.71209213256835935,"h":0.015988371561634906,"c":1},{"h":0.01380103232731289,"x":0.099701501091252615,"t":"we head off back to the hotel.","y":0.89615060291475623,"w":0.23058247884114583,"c":1},{"w":0.03454894383748372,"h":0.014534882909863822,"t":"114","y":0.95203488398111458,"c":1,"x":0.099808061785672725}],"w":2400}